  "title": "Representation of the Quantum Plane, its Quantum",
  "authors_raw": "Double and Harmonic Analysis on GL+",
  "title_lines": [
   "Representation of the Quantum Plane, its Quantum"
  ],
  "abstract": "We give complete detail of the description of the GNS represe ntation of the quantum plane A and its dual \u02c6A as a von Neumann algebra. In particu- lar we obtain a rather surprising result that the multiplica tive unitary W is manageable in this quantum semigroup context. We study the q uantum dou- ble group construction introduced by Woronowicz, and using Baaj and Vaes\u2019 construction of the multiplicative unitary Wm, we give the GNS description of the quantum double D(A) which is equivalent to GL+ q (2, R). Furthermore we study the fundamental corepresentation T \u03bb,t and its matrix coe\ufb03cients, and show that it can be expressed by the b-hypergeometric function. We also study the regular corepresentation and representatio n induced by Wm, and prove that the space of L2 functions on the quantum double decomposes into the continuous series representation of Uq ~q(gl(2, R)) with the quantum dilogarithm |Sb(Q + 2i\u03b1 )|2 as the Plancherel measure. Finally we describe certain representation theoretic meaning of integral tran sforms involving the quantum dilogarithm function. \u2217 Kavli IPMU, The University of Tokyo, 5-1-5 Kashiwanoha, Kas hiwa, 277-8583, Chiba, Japan Email: ivan.ip@ipmu.jp 1",
